<title>AUSTRIA: Lenzing details nine-month sales.</title>
<headline>Lenzing details nine-month sales.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's fibre manufacturer Lenzing AG reported the following sales figures for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>					 1996	     1995</p>
<p>    Group sales		   6,075    vs    6,042</p>
<p>Breakdown of sales at parent company and subsidiaries:</p>
<p>    Lenzing AG		    4,210	    4,354</p>
<p>    LFC				 890		936</p>
<p>    SPV			     1,047	    1,128</p>
<p>    Other			     117	     n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE - Lenzing holds 100 percent of Lenzing Fibers Corp (LFC) of the U.S., 41.98 percent of Indonesia's South Pacific Viscose (SPV) and 37.42 percent of Brazil's Bacell S.A. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 274</p>
</text>
